"text": " Two nights before the Manchester derby, Mario Balotelli's bathroom caught fire. Fireworks. October 2011. Just after midnight, a firework set the bathroom of his rented house alight. Two fire engines came. Nobody was hurt. The repair bill, reportedly \u00a3400,000. And Mario? He blamed a friend. Then, on Sunday, Manchester City went to Old Trafford. 22 minutes in, Balotelli scores And he lifts his shirt Underneath a message Why always me? He scored again after the break City won 6 goals to 1 at Old Trafford United's worst home defeat in 56 years Sir Alex Ferguson called it Our worst ever day And the funniest part? Days later, Mario became the face of a firework safety campaign Genius or chaos? Tell me in the comments",
